      "source": "https://visit-colombia.com/blog/cartagena-colombia-travel-guide"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Castillo San Felipe de Barajas, perched on San Lázaro hill, was built to protect Cartagena from landward attacks.",
